handoff's hooks keep sessions on duty. Set them once, for every project:
  Claude Code:  handoff settings claude --global
  Codex:        handoff settings codex --global
For each CLI you use that isn't set up, run its command and do what it prints, or ask one of its sessions to.
Then give each session its role: tell it, such as "you review", and it runs handoff role <role>.
